{\f1\fs28\b\cf2 Shanthi: Mindfulness Meditation App for Healthcare Workers\par}
{\f1\fs22\b Application Blueprint & Technical Documentation\par}
\line

{\f1\fs24\b\cf2 Executive Summary\par}
{\f1\fs20 Shanthi is a comprehensive mindfulness and meditation mobile application specifically designed for healthcare workers, particularly nurses. The app serves as a research platform to study nurses' mental health and well-being while providing evidence-based interventions for stress management, emotional regulation, and burnout prevention.\par}

{\f1\fs18\b Core Mission\par}
{\f1\fs20 To support healthcare workers' mental health through accessible mindfulness tools while conducting research on the effectiveness of digital mental health interventions in healthcare settings.\par}
\line

{\f1\fs24\b\cf2 Application Overview\par}

{\f1\fs18\b Target Audience\par}
{\f1\fs20 
• Primary: Registered nurses working in hospital settings\par
• Secondary: Healthcare support staff and medical professionals\par
• Research Participants: Healthcare workers enrolled in mental health studies\par}

{\f1\fs18\b Platform & Technology\par}
{\f1\fs20 
• Framework: React Native with Expo\par
• Database: Supabase (PostgreSQL)\par
• Authentication: Secure participant-based login system\par
• Platform Support: iOS and Android mobile devices\par
• Network Requirements: WiFi-only operation for data integrity\par}
\line

{\f1\fs24\b\cf2 Core Functionality\par}

{\f1\fs18\b 1. Authentication & Onboarding\par}
{\f1\fs20 Purpose: Secure participant enrollment and study compliance\par}

{\f1\fs20 Features:\par
• Participant number-based authentication system\par
• Secure password verification through Supabase database\par
• Informed consent process with multiple consent checkpoints\par
• Department selection for research stratification\par
• One-time demographic survey completion requirement\par}

{\f1\fs20 Data Collected:\par
• Participant credentials and demographic information\par
• Department and shift information\par
• Educational background and work experience\par
• Contact information for study follow-up\par}

{\f1\fs18\b 2. Demographic Data Collection\par}
{\f1\fs20 Purpose: Comprehensive participant profiling for research analysis\par}

{\f1\fs20 Survey Components (14 questions):\par
1. Sample code identification\par
2. Age group classification\par
3. Gender identity\par
4. Marital status\par
5. Educational qualifications\par
6. Professional designation\par
7. Income level assessment\par
8. Years of nursing experience\par
9. Current working unit/department\par
10. Work shift patterns\par
11. Daily work hours\par
12. Monthly night shift frequency\par
13. Place of residence\par
14. Contact number\par}

{\f1\fs18\b 3. Calm Corner: Meditation & Relaxation Hub\par}
{\f1\fs20 Purpose: Evidence-based stress reduction and mindfulness intervention\par}

{\f1\fs20 Audio Content Library:\par
• Nature Sounds: Ocean waves, rain variations (light, heavy, with thunder)\par
• Ambient Sounds: Crackling fire, brown noise variations (4 types)\par
• Guided Meditations: Professional meditation sessions (12-20 minutes)\par
• Background Playback: Continuous audio during app use\par}

{\f1\fs20 Video Content Library:\par
• Guided Breathing Exercises: Progressive breathing techniques (5-10 minutes)\par
• Visual Meditation: Screen-based breathing guides\par
• In-app Video Player: Native playback with full controls\par}

{\f1\fs18\b 4. App Usage Monitoring System\par}
{\f1\fs20 Purpose: Research-grade data collection on app engagement patterns\par}

{\f1\fs20 Tracking Capabilities:\par
• Session start/end timestamps\par
• Total app usage duration\par
• Background/foreground state detection\par
• Network connectivity impact analysis\par
• Cross-device usage patterns\par}

{\f1\fs20 Technical Implementation:\par
• Real-time AppState monitoring\par
• Automatic session management\par
• Offline data buffering and synchronization\par
• WiFi-only operation enforcement\par
• Orphaned session cleanup and recovery\par}

{\f1\fs18\b 5. Network Connectivity Management\par}
{\f1\fs20 Purpose: Ensure data quality and research compliance\par}

{\f1\fs20 WiFi-Only Operation:\par
• Real-time connectivity monitoring\par
• User-friendly WiFi requirement interface\par
• Automatic app access when connected\par
• Connection status indicators\par}

{\f1\fs20 Offline Capabilities:\par
• Local session data buffering\par
• Automatic data synchronization when online\par
• Seamless user experience during connectivity transitions\par
• No data loss during network interruptions\par}
\line

{\f1\fs24\b\cf2 Research & Monitoring Components\par}

{\f1\fs18\b Data Collection Framework\par}

{\f1\fs20 1. Usage Analytics:\par
• Daily app usage frequency\par
• Session duration patterns\par
• Feature utilization rates\par
• Peak usage times\par
• Engagement consistency over time\par}

{\f1\fs20 2. Demographic Analysis:\par
• Cross-sectional participant profiling\par
• Department-specific usage patterns\par
• Shift-based engagement analysis\par
• Experience level correlations\par}

{\f1\fs20 3. Intervention Effectiveness:\par
• Meditation content preference tracking\par
• Session completion rates\par
• Feature adoption patterns\par
• Long-term engagement metrics\par}

{\f1\fs18\b Privacy & Data Security\par}

{\f1\fs20 HIPAA-Compliant Design:\par
• No personal health information storage\par
• Anonymized participant identification\par
• Secure database encryption\par
• Limited data retention policies\par}

{\f1\fs20 Research Ethics:\par
• Informed consent requirements\par
• Voluntary participation model\par
• Data withdrawal capabilities\par
• Transparent data usage policies\par}
\line

{\f1\fs24\b\cf2 Technical Architecture\par}

{\f1\fs18\b Frontend Architecture\par}
{\f1\fs20 
• React Native: Cross-platform mobile development\par
• Expo: Development and deployment framework\par
• TypeScript: Type-safe development environment\par
• React Navigation: Screen navigation management\par}

{\f1\fs18\b Backend Infrastructure\par}
{\f1\fs20 
• Supabase: PostgreSQL database with real-time capabilities\par
• Row Level Security: Participant data isolation\par
• RESTful APIs: Secure data communication\par
• Real-time Subscriptions: Live data updates\par}

{\f1\fs18\b Database Schema\par}

{\f1\fs20 Core Tables:\par
1. participants - User authentication and basic information\par
2. demographic_surveys - One-time demographic data collection\par
3. app_usage_sessions - Detailed usage analytics\par
4. journal_entries - Optional user reflections\par
5. mood_checks - Daily emotional state tracking\par}

{\f1\fs18\b Security Implementation\par}
{\f1\fs20 
• Authentication: Supabase Auth with custom participant system\par
• Data Encryption: End-to-end encryption for sensitive data\par
• Network Security: HTTPS-only communication\par
• Local Storage: Secure device storage with encryption\par}
\line

